{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01641","headline":"杂曲歌辞 妾薄命 · 卢弼","name":"杂曲歌辞 妾薄命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君恩已断尽成空，追想娇欢恨莫穷。\n长爲蕣华光晓日，谁知团扇送秋风。\n黄金买赋心徒切，清路飞尘信莫通。\n闲凭玉栏思旧事，几回春暮泣残红。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢弼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01641.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01641","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}